{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0001", "confidence": "high", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "据Dehong Chen等对CFETR的成本测算，建造一个200MW聚变电站，等离子体约束（超导磁体）成本占比为24.9%，环向磁场线圈401.0百万美元（11.6%），极向磁场线圈166.9百万美元（4.8%），欧姆加热线圈48.8百万美元（1.4%）。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "CFETR成本拆分数据直接量化磁体在聚变堆中的金额敞口"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "在ITER装置中磁体系统、容器内部件、建筑、真空室的占比最高，分别达到28%、17%、14%、8%。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "ITER成本分布与CFETR数据相互印证"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.300483+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "refines", "to": "industry-c-2025-0007"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "arena-c-2025-0007"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "because_of", "to": "industry-c-2025-0002"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-hts-magnet-supply", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "超导磁体 成本占比 最高", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c6", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}], "text": "超导磁体是聚变堆核心设备中成本占比最高的单一部件，在CFETR中等离子体约束部件占聚变电厂总成本24.9%，环向/极向/欧姆线圈合计占聚变堆38.9%。", "type": "thesis"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0002", "confidence": "high", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "近年来，钨及钨基合金作为第一壁材料开始受到越来越多的关注和应用，ITER在2023年已确定了将第一壁材料从铍换成钨，中国EAST也是经历了向全钨的转换。因此，钨及钨基合金是目前最具应用前途的一类第一壁材料。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "ITER和EAST的实际选材决策直接验证钨基合金的主导地位"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "钨具有高熔点（3400℃）、高热导率（176W/mK）、低溅射产额和高自溅射阈值、低蒸气压和低氚滞留性能。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "材料物性参数证明钨基合金满足第一壁苛刻要求"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "ITER在2023年已确定了将第一壁材料从铍换成钨，中国EAST也是经历了向全钨的转换。因此，钨及钨基合金是目前最具应用前途的一类第一壁材料。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "ITER官方确认钨替换铍是材料选择的决定性信号"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "钨及钨基合金：具有高熔点、高热导率、低溅射产额和高自溅射阈值、低蒸气压和低氚滞留性能。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "性能优势列表支持钨作为首选材料的论断"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.094730+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "arena-c-2025-0003"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0006"}, {"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "arena-c-2025-0010"}, {"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0001"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-firstwall-material", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "第一壁 钨基合金 ITER 材料确定", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c9", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c12", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "27c6ce55"}], "text": "第一壁是聚变装置面向等离子体的关键部件，ITER已确定将材料从铍换成钨，钨及钨基合金成为最具前途的第一壁材料。", "type": "thesis"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0003", "confidence": "high", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "2022年11月22日，ITER增强热负荷第一壁完成首件制造，其核心指标显著优于设计要求，具备了批量制造条件，这标志着中国全面突破'ITER增强热负荷第一壁'关键技术。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "首件通过验收且优于设计要求，标志国内具备量产能力"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "根据ITER官方，我国承担了10%的ITER第一壁生产制造任务，中核集团核工业西南物理研究院牵头研发的第一壁采购包半原型部件，在2016年成功通过高热负荷测试，在世界上率先通过认证。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "国际认证早于其他国家，体现中国技术领先地位"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.302171+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "because_of", "to": "arena-c-2025-0002"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0006"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-firstwall-material", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "中国 第一壁 技术突破 ITER认证", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c10", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}], "text": "中国已全面突破ITER增强热负荷第一壁关键技术，2022年完成首件制造且核心指标显著优于设计要求，具备批量制造条件。", "type": "judgment"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0004", "confidence": "medium", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "可控核聚变领域近30年的研究和工程经验表明，铜合金以高热导率、较高的强度、较好的热稳定性和抗中子辐照性能被认为是聚变堆偏滤器用热沉材料的首要候选材料，也可能是水冷偏滤器热沉材料的唯一候选材料。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "三十年工程经验确立铜合金热沉材料的不可替代地位"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "可控核聚变领域近30年的研究和工程经验表明，铜合金以高热导率、较高的强度、较好的热稳定性和抗中子辐照性能被认为是聚变堆偏滤器用热沉材料的首要候选材料，也可能是水冷偏滤器热沉材料的唯一候选材料。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "30年经验支撑铜合金唯一候选地位"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "偏滤器承受高热负荷的能力限制了聚变堆运行的最大功率，而热沉材料的热物理性能和力学性能是提高偏滤器承受热负荷的关键。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "材料性能直接限制聚变堆最大功率"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.096328+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0001"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "refines", "to": "arena-c-2025-0002"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-divertor-material", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "偏滤器 铜合金 热沉材料 唯一候选", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c11", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c14", "confidence_in_source": "medium", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "27c6ce55"}], "text": "偏滤器是聚变堆中热负荷最严苛的部件，铜合金是偏滤器热沉材料的唯一候选材料，决定聚变堆最大运行功率。", "type": "thesis"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0005", "confidence": "high", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "在ITER装置成本中磁体系统、容器内部件、建筑、真空室的占比最高，分别达到28%、17%、14%、8%。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "ITER成本拆分数据量化真空室在设备总成本中的权重"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "CFETR成本测算中，真空室成本145.5百万美元，占总资本成本4.2%。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "CFETR数据佐证真空室是重要成本构成"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.304603+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "refines", "to": "industry-c-2025-0007"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0002"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-vacuum-vessel-fabrication", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "真空室 制造 成本 聚变堆", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c13", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}], "text": "真空室是托卡马克装置的关键结构支撑部件，在CFETR成本中真空室占总成本4.2%，在ITER装置成本中真空室占比约8%。", "type": "thesis"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0006", "confidence": "high", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "2024年6月18日，位于上海的聚变能源商业公司能量奇点宣布，由能量奇点设计、研发和建造的洪荒70装置成功实现等离子体放电。这是全球首台全高温超导托卡马克装置，也是全球首台由商业公司研发建设的超导托卡马克装置，这一装置的运行标志着我国在全球范围内率先完成了高温超导托卡马克的工程可行性验证。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "全球首台商业公司HTS托卡马克验证是里程碑事件"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.310460+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "because_of", "to": "industry-c-2025-0002"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "arena-c-2025-0007"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-hts-magnet-supply", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "能量奇点 全HTS 验证", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c26", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}], "text": "能量奇点2024年6月建成运行全球首台全高温超导托卡马克装置洪荒70，首次实现商业公司验证高温超导托卡马克工程可行性，为HTS磁体商业路径奠定基础。", "type": "catalyst"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0007", "confidence": "medium", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "美国CFS公司的SPARC示范装置超导带材用量就接近1万公里，瞄准实现聚变发电的ARC工程实验堆需求量可能会达到2.4万公里，而2021年全球的超导带材产能仅3000公里。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "单个装置需求量vs全球产能对比揭示供需严重失衡"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.312569+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "because_of", "to": "arena-c-2025-0001"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "arena-c-2025-0008"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-hts-magnet-supply", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "高温超导带材 需求缺口 产能不足", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c7", "confidence_in_source": "medium", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}], "text": "高温超导带材需求将爆发式增长：仅SPARC示范装置用量近1万公里，ARC工程堆需2.4万公里，而2021年全球产能仅3000公里。", "type": "thesis"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0008", "confidence": "high", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": -1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "低温超导体，如NbTi和Nb3Sn，当电流密度超过一定的值就会失去超导态，这使得NbTi和Nb3Sn磁体分别最高只能达到8T和13.5T。ITER采用Nb3Sn超导磁体，等离子体中心最高磁场强度只能达到5.3T，因此要达到500MW聚变功率的目标，科学家不得不将ITER设计得很大，等离子体大半径6.2米。", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "why": "技术参数直接说明低温超导的磁场瓶颈导致装置规模庞大"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "ITER的磁体系统主要由四部分构成，其中纵向磁场和中心螺线管采用的是Nb3Sn的超导线，用量超过500吨（总长度超过10万千米）。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "500吨用量是ITER低温超导线材需求的直接数据"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:11:31.285469+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.082088+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "industry-c-2025-0002"}, {"from_source": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977", "kind": "tension_with", "to": "arena-c-2025-0007"}, {"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "tension_with", "to": "arena-c-2025-0009"}, {"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0005"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-lts-wires", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "低温超导 磁场上限 装置大型化", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c8", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": -1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "bocisec-cn-nuclear-fusion-2025-9314b977"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c11", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "27c6ce55"}], "text": "ITER磁体系统使用Nb3Sn超导线材超500吨（总长超10万公里），低温超导线材是当前聚变装置的基础供应物资。", "type": "thesis"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0009", "confidence": "medium", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "美国CFS公司的SPARC示范装置超导带材用量就接近1万公里，瞄准实现聚变发电的ARC工程实验堆需求量可能会达到2.4万公里，而2021年全球的超导带材产能仅3000公里。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "单台需求是产能的3-8倍，量化了供给瓶颈"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.068793+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.093810+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "arena-c-2025-0008"}, {"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "because_of", "to": "industry-c-2025-0014"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-hts-magnet-supply", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "HTS带材供需严重缺口", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c10", "confidence_in_source": "medium", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "27c6ce55"}], "text": "高温超导带材处于产业化初期，SPARC单台装置需求接近1万公里，而2021年全球产能仅3000公里，供需缺口巨大。", "type": "catalyst"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0010", "confidence": "high", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "2022年11月22日，ITER增强热负荷第一壁完成首件制造，其核心指标显著优于设计要求，具备了批量制造条件，这标志着中国全面突破\"ITER增强热负荷第一壁\"关键技术。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "首件完成且优于设计指标证明中国制造能力"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "我国承担了10%的ITER第一壁生产制造任务，中核集团核工业西南物理研究院牵头研发了第一壁采购包半原型部件，在2016年成功通过高热负荷测试，在世界上率先通过认证。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "全球首个通过认证证明技术国际领先"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.068793+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.095457+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "refines", "to": "arena-c-2025-0002"}, {"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0001"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-firstwall-material", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "中国第一壁首件认证领先", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c13", "confidence_in_source": "high", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "27c6ce55"}], "text": "中国在ITER第一壁制造上已全面突破关键技术，承担约10%任务并于2022年完成首件制造，核心指标显著优于设计要求。", "type": "catalyst"}
{"claim_id": "arena-c-2025-0011", "confidence": "medium", "direction": 1, "evidence": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "我国承担了50%的屏蔽模块制造任务。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "50%份额证明中国在ITER真空室部件制造中的主导角色"}, {"as_of": "2025-04-10", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "page": null, "quote": "中国在ITER项目中负责18个采购包的实物贡献，包括磁体支撑、校正场线圈、环向场线圈导体、极向场线圈导体、第一壁、屏蔽包层等核心部件。", "source_id": "27c6ce55", "why": "18个采购包覆盖说明产业链整体能力"}], "first_seen_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.068793+00:00", "last_updated_at": "2026-05-05T19:20:14.097195+00:00", "relations": [{"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "industry-c-2025-0013"}, {"from_source": "27c6ce55", "kind": "leads_to", "to": "company-c-2025-0002"}], "schema_version": "v3", "scope_ref": "cn-fusion-vacuum-vessel-fabrication", "scope_type": "arena", "semantic_key": "中国真空室制造承担份额", "sources": [{"as_of": "2025-04-10", "bundle_local_id": "c15", "confidence_in_source": "medium", "direction_in_source": 1, "institution": "中银国际证券", "source_id": "27c6ce55"}], "text": "真空室制造是聚变堆核心工程能力之一，中国在ITER项目中承担了50%的屏蔽模块制造任务，具备完整制造能力。", "type": "thesis"}
